        description: "Owner or administrator console session, the same door as the other auth/admin routes. Since 2.52.0. Returns the limits that apply, the defaults, the bounds both numbers must stay inside and the three kinds that exist: sign_in counts sign-in attempts per identity, mail counts requested action mails per identity, refresh counts token renewals per session family. configured is false while the environment never stored a setting; the defaults then apply. Any query parameter is a 400.",
