        description: "Owner or administrator console session, the same door as the other auth/admin routes. Since 2.53.0. Returns whether newly chosen passwords are checked against a list of known leaked passwords, the minimum length a password must reach, what a refusal is allowed to say, and what may be said about the loaded list: its origin (built_in or file), its digest algorithm, the prefix length of its entries and how many entries it holds. Never a file path and never an entry. configured is false while the environment never stored a setting; the defaults then apply, which means the check is off. Any query parameter is a 400.",
